# OpenTail

Theme is `public_html/catalog/view/theme/default` (not `tailwind`).

- New or changed UI kit piece → skill `add-component` (Twig + CSS + JS + Components gallery).
- Where a style or script belongs → skill `theme-assets`.
- Markdown guide on `/docs` → skill `add-docs-page` (`docs/en` + `docs/ru`, register in `docs/catalog.php`; screenshots in `docs/images/`).

Do not put component CSS in `stylesheet.css` or `docs.css`. Do not put docs CSS in the store bundle.
